  "rule": "MiniMax's user-code device sign-in, stood in for offline. The code step POSTs response_type, client_id, scope, code_challenge (S256) and state, and answers user_code, verification_uri and an absolute expired_in. The token step POSTs grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:user_code, client_id, user_code and code_verifier: a code_verifier that does not match the challenge answers status 'error'; an unapproved code answers status 'pending'; an approved code answers status 'success' with access_token, refresh_token and expired_in; an expired code answers a non-ok body whose base_resp.status_msg is the reason. The pinned source has no refresh_token grant.",
